### Pattern 5: Intercepting Routes (Modal Pattern)

```typescript
// File structure for photo modal
// app/
// ├── @modal/
// │   ├── (.)photos/[id]/page.tsx  # Intercept
// │   └── default.tsx
// ├── photos/
// │   └── [id]/page.tsx            # Full page
